      "utf8": "negative sign and makes the right side of the equation positive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332340,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The acceleration is therefore positive which means dark energy is pushing outwards to"
